{"id":"cca2b066cf07f3e7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-unique-choice.md","title":"单值关系的唯一选择","display":"df-unique-choice — 单值关系的唯一选择","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-unique-choice","aliases":["16-df-unique-choice"],"display":"df-unique-choice — 单值关系的唯一选择","depends_on":["[[16-df-subset-type]]","[[16-df-internal-equality]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Definition4.9.1 p.304 (PDF324); Proposition4.9.2 p.305 (PDF325)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-unique-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-unique-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unique-choice — 单值关系的唯一选择"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92bb081cf777d22b\" href=\"?note=92bb081cf777d22b\" title=\"16-df-subset-type\">16-df-subset-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition4.9.1 p.304 (PDF324); Proposition4.9.2 p.305 (PDF325)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92bb081cf777d22b\" href=\"?note=92bb081cf777d22b\" title=\"16-df-subset-type\">16-df-subset-type</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>，并采用该结构指定的重索引、有限积与纤维序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 为基对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(q:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:I\\times J\\to J\">\\(r:I\\times J\\to J\\)</span> 为所选积的投影族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,r,a,b\">\\(q,r,a,b\\)</span> 均随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 变化并省略参数下标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:I\\times(J\\times J)\\to I\\times J\">\\(a,b:I\\times(J\\times J)\\to I\\times J\\)</span> 如下定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 为纤维积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_p\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SingleValued}\">\\(\\mathsf{SingleValued}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ExistsValue}\">\\(\\mathsf{ExistsValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}\">\\(\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}\\)</span> 为下文谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_1\\pi_2\\rangle,\\qquad b\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\na^*R\\wedge b^*R\\le_{I\\times(J\\times J)}\n\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1\\pi_2,\\pi_2\\pi_2),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\in\\mathcal E_I\\land(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(S\\le_IY\\Longleftrightarrow R\\le_{I\\times J}q^*Y\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\n\\Bigl[\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists S\\in\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{R\\},\\{S\\}))\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)\\land\\pi_Sh=q\\pi_R\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_1\\pi_2\\rangle,\\qquad b\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\na^*R\\wedge b^*R\\le_{I\\times(J\\times J)}\n\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1\\pi_2,\\pi_2\\pi_2),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\in\\mathcal E_I\\land(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(S\\le_IY\\Longleftrightarrow R\\le_{I\\times J}q^*Y\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\n\\Bigl[\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists S\\in\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{R\\},\\{S\\}))\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)\\land\\pi_Sh=q\\pi_R\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ExistsValue}\">\\(\\mathsf{ExistsValue}\\)</span> 给出仅在这个关系处需要的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_qR\">\\(\\Sigma_qR\\)</span>，不要求所有谓词都有存在量词。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\le q^*S\">\\(R\\le q^*S\\)</span> 和子类型因子泛性质，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 存在且唯一；定义要求它可逆。存在值在预序中唯一到同构，因此条件不依赖选取哪一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书 Proposition4.9.2 的证明：单值子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\hookrightarrow I\\times J\">\\(R\\hookrightarrow I\\times J\\)</span> 的第一投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_0:R\\to I\">\\(r_0:R\\to I\\)</span> 为单态射。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_0u=r_0v\">\\(r_0u=r_0v\\)</span>，单值性给第二投影相等，再由关系的单态射性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span>。故在子对象纤维化中可直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_0\">\\(r_0\\)</span> 表示存在值，比较映射为恒等。这里的 unique choice 是唯一见证，不是假定任意满关系都有选择函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-subset-type","status":"resolved","id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subset-type","status":"resolved","id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 满足 [[16-df-subset-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$；$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，并采用该结构指定的重索引、有限积与纤维序。$I,J$ 为基对象，$q:I\\times J\\to I$、$r:I\\times J\\to J$ 为所选积的投影族；$q,r,a,b$ 均随 $I,J$ 变化并省略参数下标。$a,b:I\\times(J\\times J)\\to I\\times J$ 如下定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}$，$\\wedge$ 为纤维积；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]，$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$\\mathsf{SingleValued}$、$\\mathsf{ExistsValue}$、$\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}$ 为下文谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}$，$\\wedge$ 为纤维积；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]，$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$\\mathsf{SingleValued}$、$\\mathsf{ExistsValue}$、$\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}$ 为下文谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"I,J","display":false},{"tex":"q:I\\times J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"r:I\\times J\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"q,r,a,b","display":false},{"tex":"I,J","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:I\\times(J\\times J)\\to I\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SingleValued}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ExistsValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na&\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_1\\pi_2\\rangle,\\qquad b\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)&\\Longleftrightarrow\na^*R\\wedge b^*R\\le_{I\\times(J\\times J)}\n\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1\\pi_2,\\pi_2\\pi_2),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\in\\mathcal E_I\\land(\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(S\\le_IY\\Longleftrightarrow R\\le_{I\\times J}q^*Y\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\n\\Bigl[\\mathsf{SingleValued}_p(I,J,R)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\exists S\\in\\mathcal E_I)(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{R\\},\\{S\\}))\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{ExistsValue}_p(q,R,S)\\land\\pi_Sh=q\\pi_R\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ExistsValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_qR","display":false},{"tex":"R\\le q^*S","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\hookrightarrow I\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"r_0:R\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"r_0u=r_0v","display":false},{"tex":"u=v","display":false},{"tex":"r_0","display":false}],"bytes":2693,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]、[[16-df-unique-choice]]、[[16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal]]、[[16-thm-sub-characterization]]、[[16-thm-split-replacement]]。分裂替代采用与其断言一致的文件名；其结论是纤维等价与指定分裂的构造。"},{"id":"775a56acaa867972","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反向：已定义判据直接给满子类型。通过每个纤维的满忠实且满射比较，将有限积、重索引和对角相等伴随运输到子对象纤维化；理解比较保持这些结构（Lemma4.6.2），相等伴随唯一到同构，故相等谓词对应对角子对象，得到很强相等。子对象中单值关系的第一投影是单态射，按 [[16-df-unique-choice]] 的证明有存在值与可逆比较；运输回去即唯一选择。预序等价只要求同构类上的逆，不假定全局字面逆或额外全局选择。"}],"outgoing":["92bb081cf777d22b","93b3305f115fb8fd","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}